              "sv": 1001001,
              "ev": 1001001,
              "verses": [
                {
                  "sv": 1001001,
                  "commentary": {
                    "text": "The verb translated created is reserved in Hebrew for divine activity. It is never used with a human subject, which is the first thing the sentence tells us about its subject.",
